| !Run for !Lumen, a photo library and editor
| !RunImage is a UnixLib program converted to Absolute (AIF), so it needs
| SharedUnixLibrary and ARMEABISupport (both from PackMan).
Set Lumen$Dir <Obey$Dir>
IconSprites <Lumen$Dir>.!Sprites
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 IfThere System:Modules.SharedULib Then RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error Lumen needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later. Install it with PackMan.
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 IfThere System:Modules.ARMEABISupport Then RMLoad System:Modules.ARMEABISupport
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 Error Lumen needs the ARMEABISupport module. Install it with PackMan.
| The library: Lumen's Choices window says where it is; set Lumen$Library
| before running to override that. Otherwise it goes in the user's
| Choices, or (no Choices yet, e.g. before the desktop has finished
| starting) beside !Lumen. (Earlier Lumens set Lumen$Library to the usual
| place themselves: that is forgotten, so the Choices window counts.)
Set Lumen$DefaultLibrary <Choices$Write>.Lumen.Library
If "<Lumen$DefaultLibrary>"=".Lumen.Library" Then Set Lumen$DefaultLibrary <Lumen$Dir>.^.LumenLibrary
If "<Lumen$Library>"="<Lumen$DefaultLibrary>" Then Unset Lumen$Library
WimpSlot -min 5120K -max 5120K
Run <Lumen$Dir>.!RunImage
